        "original_id": "fb9f705e-7822-5cfe-8ea4-2ffd86795686",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Audie Murphy, Jesse Hibbs\n- Films: To Hell and Back\n- Awards: Medal of Honor\n- Military Events: Colmar Pocket\n- Places: France\n\nFacts:\n- In January 1945, Audie Murphy demonstrated valor at the Colmar Pocket in France by holding off an entire company of German soldiers for an hour and then leading a successful counterattack while wounded and out of ammunition.\n- Audie Murphy received the Medal of Honor for his actions at the Colmar Pocket in France at age 19.\n- The film To Hell and Back was directed by Jesse Hibbs.\n- The film To Hell and Back starred Audie Murphy as himself.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
